[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12242.07, "timestamp": "03:24:02", "text": "是的。什么？什么是香草？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12244.63, "timestamp": "03:24:04", "text": "基本上就是香草味。香草。基本上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12247.99, "timestamp": "03:24:07", "text": "未修改的游戏版本。原版"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12250.55, "timestamp": "03:24:10", "text": "一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12253.19, "timestamp": "03:24:13", "text": "基本上，这些就是那些暴徒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12255.03, "timestamp": "03:24:15", "text": "在 Minecraft 更新中，但他们没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12257.67, "timestamp": "03:24:17", "text": "有机会展示它们。就像他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12259.349, "timestamp": "03:24:19", "text": "你知道，《我的世界》搞了个投票活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12262.229, "timestamp": "03:24:22", "text": "每次更新都会出现这个东西。哦，是的。这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12265.269, "timestamp": "03:24:25", "text": "是的，这些都被遗漏了。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12267.51, "timestamp": "03:24:27", "text": "通过模组添加的。显然，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12269.67, "timestamp": "03:24:29", "text": "应该是我，我不确定它是否是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12272.87, "timestamp": "03:24:32", "text": "或不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12275.349, "timestamp": "03:24:35", "text": "是的，这是官方的Minecraft模组。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12277.11, "timestamp": "03:24:37", "text": "等等，那条小巷呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12278.309, "timestamp": "03:24:38", "text": "东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12280.71, "timestamp": "03:24:40", "text": "阿里是香草口味的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12282.79, "timestamp": "03:24:42", "text": "这个版本里没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12288.15, "timestamp": "03:24:48", "text": "不，确实如此。这是。这是。 Ali 感觉棒极了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12290.66, "timestamp": "03:24:50", "text": "是的。看，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12291.83, "timestamp": "03:24:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12294.59, "timestamp": "03:24:54", "text": "看。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12298.79, "timestamp": "03:24:58", "text": "离开。那是什么？"}]